  "body": "In addition to voice and video calling, it would be very useful to have text calling, in which one could see what the others are typing, *in real time*.\r\n\r\nIt should use the same protocol(s) as voice/video calling, but should instead transfer text, rather than voice.\r\n\r\nThis would be a groundbreaking feature, and would close the gap between simple messaging and voice calling.\r\n",
